      "text": "came unto him a centurion, beseeching him, Matt. 8:5. devils besought him, Matt. 8:31 (Mark 5:12; Luke 8:32). came a leper to him, beseeching him, Mark 1:40. besought him greatly, saying, My little daughter lieth, Mark 5:23. besought him that he would cast forth the devil, Mark 7:26. beseeching … that he would come and heal his servant, Luke 7:3. Master, I beseech thee, look upon my son, Luke 9:38. they besought him that he would tarry with them, John 4:40. besought him that he would come down, and heal his son, John 4:47. I beseech you, be ye followers of me, 1 Cor. 4:16. beseech you also that ye receive not … in vain, 2 Cor. 6:1. For this thing I besought the Lord thrice, 2 Cor. 12:8. Brethren, I beseech you, be as I am, Gal. 4:12. beseech you that ye walk worthy of the vocation, Eph. 4:1. I beseech you … abstain from fleshly lusts, 1 Pet. 2:11.",
